{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:44:644","content":{"id":644,"title":"基础知识","content":[{"type":"project-card-list","items":[{"id":646,"title":"变量声明","summary":"变量声明，使用 let 声明类型，默认是不可变的要使得变量可变，应当在 let 后加上 mut使用 let 声明变量后，后续可以继续声明，后续的声明会覆盖前面的","target":{"key":"doc:project:44:646","type":"doc","id":646}},{"id":673,"title":"基本数据类型","summary":"Rust 的基本数据类型有数字整数浮点数字符布尔元组数组数字数字分为整数和浮点数，整数根据表达的位数不同，是否支持负值，又可以细分，整数类型的名称是类型+位数的","target":{"key":"doc:project:44:673","type":"doc","id":673}}],"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Rust","target":{"key":"doc:project:44:644","type":"doc","id":644}},{"label":"基础知识","target":{"key":"doc:project:44:644","type":"doc","id":644}}],"nextPage":{"title":"变量声明","target":{"key":"doc:project:44:646","type":"doc","id":646}},"createTime":1703406084250,"updateTime":1743303640564,"projectId":44},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640564}}